</h3></div><div class="s1pn9j63 atm_7l_1kkyeqd atm_bx_nm7nsd atm_cs_1dh25pa atm_c8_dlk8xv atm_g3_gktfv dir dir-ltr"><span class="l1h825yc atm_kd_adww2_24z95b atm_lj_exct8b_1h9txp6 atm_gd_11lxctn_mwew1y atm_ge_1wthbno_mwew1y dir dir-ltr">The outdoor kitchen, firepit, alfresco dining, and BBQ area are great for summer trips.</span></div></div></div></div></div><div><div><div class="i1co4np3 atm_9s_1txwivl atm_cx_exct8b atm_cx_1tcgj5g__oggzyc i1wpetom atm_1c_1vkmtt atm_1k_i20lr3 atm_y_b47a47 dir dir-ltr"><div class="i2v8z1i atm_bb_idpfg4 atm_j_1y6m0gg atm_vy_1ylpe5n atm_9s_1txwivl atm_fc_1h6ojuz dir dir-ltr"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 32 32" aria-hidden="true" role="presentation" focusable="false" style="display: block; height: 24px; width: 24px; fill: currentcolor;"><path d="M13.7 13.93a4 4 0 0 1 5.28.6l.29.37 4.77 6.75a4 4 0 0 1 .6 3.34 4 4 0 0 1-4.5 2.91l-.4-.08-3.48-.93a1 1 0 0 0-.52 0l-3.47.93a4 4 0 0 1-2.94-.35l-.4-.25a4 4 0 0 1-1.2-5.2l.23-.37 4.77-6.75a4 4 0 0 1 .96-.97zm3.75 1.9a2 2 0 0 0-2.98.08l-.1.14-4.84 6.86a2 2 0 0 0 2.05 3.02l.17-.04 4-1.07a1 1 0 0 1 .5 0l3.97 1.06.15.04a2 2 0 0 0 2.13-2.97l-4.95-7.01zM27 12a4 4 0 1 1 0 8 4 4 0 0 1 0-8zM5 12a4 4 0 1 1 0 8 4 4 0 0 1 0-8zm22 2a2 2 0 1 0 0 4 2 2 0 0 0 0-4zM5 14a2 2 0 1 0 0 4 2 2 0 0 0 0-4zm6-10a4 4 0 1 1 0 8 4 4 0 0 1 0-8zm10 0a4 4 0 1 1 0 8 4 4 0 0 1 0-8zM11 6a2 2 0 1 0 0 4 2 2 0 0 0 0-4zm10 0a2 2 0 1 0 0 4 2 2 0 0 0 0-4z"></path></svg></div><div><div class="t1rcwhb3 atm_7l_1dmvgf5 atm_bx_nm7nsd atm_cs_1mexzig atm_c8_dlk8xv atm_g3_gktfv atm_gq_yh40bf dir dir-ltr"><h3 tabindex="-1" role="heading" aria-level="3" class="hpipapi atm_7l_1kw7nm4 atm_c8_1x4eueo atm_cs_1kw7nm4 atm_g3_1kw7nm4 atm_gi_idpfg4 atm_l8_idpfg4 atm_kd_idpfg4_pfnrn2 dir dir-ltr" elementtiming="LCP-target">Furry friends welcome</h3></div><div class="s1pn9j63 atm_7l_1kkyeqd atm_bx_nm7nsd atm_cs_1dh25pa atm_c8_dlk8xv atm_g3_gktfv dir dir-ltr"><span class="l1h825yc atm_kd_adww2_24z95b atm_lj_exct8b_1h9txp6 atm_gd_11lx