2_13uojos atm_5j_1y44olf_13uojos atm_l8_1s2714j_13uojos r1giukoi atm_c8_721710__oggzyc atm_g3_10ylmn4__oggzyc atm_fr_1ftnk8k__oggzyc dir dir-ltr"><div style="line-height: 1.5rem; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; display: -webkit-box; -webkit-line-clamp: 3; -webkit-box-orient: vertical;"><span><span class="ljci3ej atm_kd_adww2_24z95b dir dir-ltr">The accommodation was exactly as we had imagined it from the moment we saw the photos. Everything was in order and clean. Mr. Guillermo was very friendly. I would go back to the place again. We had an amazing Christmas. My only suggestion is this: You need to fix the internet, because it never worked for us. He was always really bad. Everything else was GREAT. We quickly adapted to the house.</span></span></div></div><div class="s1fdc30v atm_h3_ftgil2 atm_c8_1vo8fgo atm_g3_jemlq2 dir dir-ltr"><button role="button" aria-describedby="review_1591407720488220823_title" type="button" class="l1ovpqvx atm_npmupv_14b5rvc_10saat9 atm_4s4swg_18xq13z_10saat9 atm_u9em2p_1r3889l_10saat9 atm_1ezpcqw_1u41vd9_10saat9 atm_fyjbsv_c4n71i_10saat9 atm_1rna0z7_1uk391_10saat9 bzd8srm atm_bx_1kw7nm4 atm_cd_1kw7nm4 atm_ci_1kw7nm4 atm_g3_1kw7nm4 atm_9j_tlke0l_1nos8r_uv4tnr atm_rd_8stvzk_1nos8r_uv4tnr atm_7l_1kw7nm4_pfnrn2 atm_rd_8stvzk_pfnrn2 c1gz35do atm_1s_glywfm atm_26_1j28jx2 atm_3f_idpfg4 atm_9j_tlke0l atm_gi_idpfg4 atm_l8_idpfg4 atm_vb_1wugsn5 atm_7l_1uzht41 atm_rd_8stvzk atm_56vwhq_t94yts atm_16ejy4t_yh40bf atm_ry_3svrxs atm_td_13d8od5 atm_uc_1p1pi30 atm_5j_1y44olf atm_c8_194ox4n atm_cs_1pcbrjh atm_r3_1kw7nm4 atm_mk_h2mmj6 atm_kd_glywfm atm_9j_13gfvf7_1o5j5ji atm_rd_glywfm_1mj13j2_uv4tnr atm_uc_glywfm__1rrf6b5 atm_7l_1uzht41_v5whe7 atm_7l_1uzht41_1nos8r_uv4tnr atm_56vwhq_df88pv_1nos8r_uv4tnr atm_ry_3svrxs_1nos8r_uv4tnr atm_7l_1r9ct3d_4fughm_uv4tnr atm_rd_8stvzk_4fughm_uv4tnr atm_9j_13gfvf7_1cxuzpn_uv4tnr atm_3f_glywfm_jo46a5 atm_l8_idpfg4_jo46a5 atm_gi_idpfg4_jo46a5 atm_3f_glywfm_1icshfk atm_kd_glywfm_19774hq atm_7l_1unxc8z_1w3cfyq a