" role="presentation" focusable="false" style="display: block; height: 0.5625rem; width: 0.5625rem; fill: var(--palette-hof);"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="m15.1 1.58-4.13 8.88-9.86 1.27a1 1 0 0 0-.54 1.74l7.3 6.57-1.97 9.85a1 1 0 0 0 1.48 1.06l8.62-5 8.63 5a1 1 0 0 0 1.48-1.06l-1.97-9.85 7.3-6.57a1 1 0 0 0-.55-1.73l-9.86-1.28-4.12-8.88a1 1 0 0 0-1.82 0z"></path></svg><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 32 32" aria-hidden="true" role="presentation" focusable="false" style="display: block; height: 0.5625rem; width: 0.5625rem; fill: var(--palette-hof);"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="m15.1 1.58-4.13 8.88-9.86 1.27a1 1 0 0 0-.54 1.74l7.3 6.57-1.97 9.85a1 1 0 0 0 1.48 1.06l8.62-5 8.63 5a1 1 0 0 0 1.48-1.06l-1.97-9.85 7.3-6.57a1 1 0 0 0-.55-1.73l-9.86-1.28-4.12-8.88a1 1 0 0 0-1.82 0z"></path></svg><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 32 32" aria-hidden="true" role="presentation" focusable="false" style="display: block; height: 0.5625rem; width: 0.5625rem; fill: var(--palette-deco);"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="m15.1 1.58-4.13 8.88-9.86 1.27a1 1 0 0 0-.54 1.74l7.3 6.57-1.97 9.85a1 1 0 0 0 1.48 1.06l8.62-5 8.63 5a1 1 0 0 0 1.48-1.06l-1.97-9.85 7.3-6.57a1 1 0 0 0-.55-1.73l-9.86-1.28-4.12-8.88a1 1 0 0 0-1.82 0z"></path></svg></div><div class="d18zzpuj atm_7l_1kkyeqd atm_cs_1dh25pa atm_l8_1s5ai0k dir dir-ltr" aria-hidden="true"><span class="a8jt5op atm_3f_idpfg4 atm_7h_hxbz6r atm_7i_ysn8ba atm_e2_t94yts atm_ks_zryt35 atm_l8_idpfg4 atm_mk_stnw88 atm_vv_1q9ccgz atm_vy_t94yts dir dir-ltr">, </span><span aria-hidden="true"> · </span></div><div class="d18si1uy atm_7l_1kkyeqd atm_cs_1dh25pa atm_c8_1h3mmnw__oggzyc atm_g3_1vnrj90__oggzyc atm_fr_b3emyl__oggzyc dir dir-ltr">January 2025</div><div class="d18zzpuj atm_l8_1s5ai0k r1tqnp3m atm_7l_1kkyeqd atm_cs_1dh25pa dir dir-ltr" aria-hidden="true"><span class="a8jt5op atm_3f_idpfg4 atm_7h_hxbz6r atm_7i_ysn8ba atm_e2_t94yts atm_ks_zryt35 atm_l8_idpfg4 atm_mk_stnw88 atm_vv_1q9ccgz atm_vy_t94yts dir dir-ltr">, </span><span aria-hidden="true"> · </span></div><div class="r1tqnp3m atm_7l_1kkyeqd atm_cs_1dh25pa r7jjj8 atm_c8_1h3mmnw__oggzyc atm_g3_1vnrj90__oggzyc atm_fr_b3emyl__oggzyc dir dir-ltr">Stayed with a pet</div></div></div><div><div class="r1czmkpv atm_c8_1j2uy4x atm_g3_ly1brh atm_fr_lu0kve atm_vv_1jtmq4 atm_kz_1hnarqo atm_26_lfmit2_13uojos atm_5j_1y44olf_13uojos atm_l8_1s2714j_13uojos r1giukoi atm_c8_721710__oggzyc atm_g3_10ylmn4__oggzyc atm_fr_1ftnk8k__oggzyc dir dir-ltr"><div style="line-height: 1.5rem; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; display: -webkit-box; -webkit-line-clamp: 3; -webkit-box-orient: vertical;"><span><span class="ljci3ej atm_kd_adww2_24z95b dir dir-ltr">Las Marias lodging is a cozy place, spacious and with all the comfort we were looking for to spend our decembrino rest. Mr. Guillermo was an attentive host and greeted us personally at the property. The house is a charm:  its cute rooms and comfortable beds, showers, its equipped kitchen, the wonderful outdoor sharing stay, its garden and barbecue area were the environments we most enjoyed. Additionally, the location between Merida and Páramo seemed exceptional to enjoy both options for tours and expeditions.<br>Additional is suitable for pets, we carry two puppies and were comfortable and exercised all the time.<br>Only one recommendation and it is to activate some internet service, since only the Digitel signal comes in.</span></span></div></div><div class="s1fdc30v atm_h3_ftgil2 atm_c8_1vo8fgo atm_g3_jemlq2 dir dir-ltr"><button role="button" aria-describedby="review_1326232667702891373_title" type="button" class="l1ovpqvx atm_npmupv_14b5rvc_10saat9 atm_4s4swg_18xq13z_10saat9 atm_u9em2p_1r3889l_10saat9 atm_1ezpcqw_1u41vd9_10saat9 atm_fyjbsv_c4n71i_10saat9 atm_1rna0z7_1uk391_10saat9 bzd8srm atm_bx_1kw7nm4 atm_cd_1kw7nm4 atm_ci_1kw7nm4 atm_g3_1kw7nm4 atm_9j_tlke0l_1nos8r_uv4tnr atm_rd_8stvzk_1nos8r_uv4tnr atm_7l_1kw7nm4_pfnrn2 atm_rd_8stvzk_pfnrn2 c1gz35do atm_1s_glywfm atm_26_1j28jx2 a